{"speciesId":852,"names":{"fr":"Poulpaf","es":"Clobbopus","en":"Clobbopus","ja":"タタッコ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il se rend sur la terre ferme pour se nourrir. Très curieux, son premier réflexe est de frapper tout ce qu’il voit avec ses tentacules."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Emerge a tierra firme en busca de alimento. Su extrema curiosidad lo induce a golpear con los tentáculos todo lo que entra en su campo visual."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It’s very curious, but its means of investigating things is to try to punch them with its tentacles. The search for food is what brings it onto land."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"餌を 求め 地上に 上がる。 好奇心旺盛で 目にしたものは とりあえず 触手で 殴る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il a l’intelligence d’un enfant de trois ans. Il perd souvent ses tentacules, mais comme ils repoussent, il ne s’en soucie guère."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su inteligencia es similar a la de un niño de tres años. Sus tentáculos se desprenden a menudo, pero ni se inmuta, ya que se regeneran solos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Its tentacles tear off easily, but it isn’t alarmed when that happens—it knows they’ll grow back. It’s about as smart as a three-year-old."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"３歳児 くらいの 賢さ。 触手は よくちぎれるが 再生するので 気にしない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":852,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[20,"level-up",10]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"submission","learns":[[20,"level-up",30]]},{"name":"seismic-toss","learns":[[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"waterfall","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"snore","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"reversal","learns":[[20,"level-up",40],[